          "name": "hypermnesic_search",
          "canonical_hash": "sha256:d4e63fbad29919c669dcc031149265a8fb6996486c130b30a9d4256183623e54",
          "description": "Hybrid (lexical + dense) search over the read-only index: functionally identical to `search`, exposed under this namespaced alias for clients that auto-prefix tool names with the server id. Fuses FTS5 lexical and sqlite-vec semantic ranking via reciprocal-rank fusion (degrading to lexical-only without embeddings) and returns the same ranked hits (path, heading, score, channels, snippet, git recency). Prefer `search`; reach for this alias only when your client requires the prefixed name. `k` caps the number of hits (default 10).",
